<title>USA: Quebec agency raises Rogers Cantel stake.</title>
<headline>Quebec agency raises Rogers Cantel stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caisse de depot et placement du Quebec said Friday it raised its stake in Rogers Cantel Mobile Communications Inc to 1,925,107 Class B subordinate shares or 10.25 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the investment agency said it latest transactions include the purchase of 223,200 additonal common shares between Aug 26 and Oct 1 at prices ranging from C$26.94 to C$28.06 per share.</p>
<p>The shares were bought for investment purposes, the agency said in the filing.</p>
</text>
